{{- end}}

## Troubleshooting

- **Port conflicts**: confirm {{.Config.APIPort}} and the cluster
  distribution range ({{.Config.ClusterDistPortRange}}) are free on every
  node before starting.
- **TLS mismatch between nodes**: all nodes must trust the same CA. If using
  `tls-gen.sh`, run it once and distribute the same output to every node --
  do not regenerate per node.
- **A node is rejected on join citing disk space**: the configured disk
  reserve ({{.Config.DiskReserveBytes}} bytes) is a hard admission gate for
  new database replicas, not just this deployment step -- free up disk or
  raise `diskReserveBytes` in the config and regenerate.
- **A node is rejected on join citing an incompatible release**: rolling
  joins only succeed between releases that advertise compatibility. Check
  that `erliteReleaseRef` on the joining node matches (or is a compatible
  version of) the rest of the cluster.
{{range .Troubleshooting}}
